  <programDescriptions>
      <programName xml:lang="en">TOGAF® Training – Foundation (2day)</programName>
      <programSummaryText xml:lang="en">Two day online accredited TOGAF Foundation training including exam voucher</programSummaryText>
      <programDescriptionText xml:lang="en">This two-day live online TOGAF® Foundation training provides a structured introduction to Enterprise Architecture, including its fundamental concepts, terminology, principles and the TOGAF Architecture Development Method (ADM).

It prepares participants for the official TOGAF Enterprise Architecture Foundation certification exam, based on the TOGAF Standard, 10th Edition.

Included in the training:
- Two days of live online, instructor-led training by an experienced Enterprise Architecture trainer
- Digital course documentation
- TOGAF Foundation practice exams
- Official Foundation certification exam voucher
- Exam protection (option)

The training is accredited by The Open Group and delivered by The Unit Company, an established Enterprise Architecture training provider since 2008.

Over 90% of participants pass their certification exam on the first attempt.
Participants can schedule their certification exam with the provided voucher after completing the training.


This TOGAF® Training - Foundation from The Unit Company is accredited by The Open Group
TOGAF® is a registered trademark of The Open Group</programDescriptionText>
      <webLink xml:lang="en">https://theunitcompany.com/en/</webLink>
  </programDescriptions>

